{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Balmer谱"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Balmer 谱"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>环的"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴化","text":"范畴化"}},{"Plain":"称为 $2$-环, 大致上是"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半"}},{"Local":{"url":"稳定无穷范畴","text":"稳定 $\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":". 环的"},{"Local":{"url":"谱(代数)","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"在 $2$-环中有一类比, 其中的点是所谓厚张量理想 (thick tensor ideal), 厚的意思是关于 "},{"Local":{"url":"余纤维列","text":"(余) 纤维"}},{"Plain":"与"},{"Local":{"url":"收缩","text":"收缩"}},{"Plain":"封闭. 在"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦范畴","text":"同伦范畴"}},{"Plain":"的层面这一概念称为张量三角范畴的 <strong>Balmer 谱</strong>.</p>\n"}]}}